### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### ============ FLIGHTS ============

### Get all flights (basic - ohne Relations)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/flights

### Get all flights WITH FULL RELATIONS (passengers, plane, origin, destination)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/flights?include=relations

### Get ONE specific flight by ID (mit allen Relations)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/flights/REPLACE_WITH_FLIGHT_ID

### ============ PASSENGERS ============

### Get all passengers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/passengers

### Create new passenger
POST http://localhost:3000/api/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Spas",
  "lastName": "Spasov",
  "email": "spas.spasov@example.com"
}

### ============ PLANES ============

### Get all planes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/planes

### Create new plane
POST http://localhost:3000/api/planes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Boeing 737",
  "capacity": 230
}

### ============ AIRPORTS ============

### Get all airports
GET http://localhost:3000/api/airports

### Create new airport
POST http://localhost:3000/api/airports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Flughafen Berlin Brandenburg Willy Brandt",
  "iataCode": "BER",
  "city": "Berlin"
}

### ============ CREATE FLIGHT ============

### Create new flight
POST http://localhost:3000/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNumber": "OS123",
  "departureTime": "2025-12-01T10:00:00Z",
  "arrivalTime": "2025-12-01T12:00:00Z",
  "originId": "16b8146e-af12-4ad2-a147-d1ff55d857fd",
  "destinationId": "274fa00b-59bf-4839-94f4-cf54c82408f7",
  "planeId": "f6ce9518-e973-4c23-bac9-109c262e1738"
}

### ============ BOOK PASSENGERS ============

### Book passengers to flight
POST http://localhost:3000/api/flights/REPLACE_WITH_FLIGHT_ID/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerIds": [
    "Passenger_ID_1",
    "Passenger_ID_2"
  ]
}
